{"4241280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Call of Smoking Snakes", "steam_appid": 4241280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call of Smoking Snakes</strong> is a multiplayer FPS set during World War II, focused on intense combat, teamwork, and territory control. Jump into fast-paced online battles, choose your class, and fight across varied maps that demand strategy, smart positioning, and coordinated teamplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you choose your side: <strong>Smoking Snakes</strong> or <strong>Black Eagles</strong> — two opposing forces locked in direct conflict for control of the battlefield. Every match features constant firefights, coordinated advances, and split-second decisions that can turn the tide of battle at any moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classes and Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on different roles on the frontline, such as <strong>infantry</strong>, <strong>sniper</strong>, <strong>machine gunner</strong>, or <strong>bazooka</strong>, each with a clearly defined tactical purpose. Use historical weapons, take advantage of the terrain, and work together with your team to capture and hold strategic objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is direct and intense: every weapon has weight, every shot counts, and victory depends on collective performance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maps and Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps offer a wide range of scenarios, including <strong>tight indoor areas</strong>, <strong>narrow alleys</strong>, and <strong>open fields</strong>, requiring quick situational awareness and constant adaptation. There is no single way to play — success comes from knowing when to push, when to hold, and when to act as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why “Smoking Snakes”?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The name <strong>Smoking Snakes</strong> comes from a historical expression linked to the <strong>Brazilian Expeditionary Force (FEB)</strong>. Before Brazil entered the war, it was said that it would be “easier for a snake to smoke than for Brazil to fight in Europe.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Brazilian soldiers finally went into combat, they adopted the smoking snake as their symbol — turning doubt into identity and pride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Call of Smoking Snakes</strong>, this spirit represents determination, unity, and the idea that when the snake enters combat, <strong>it smokes</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Together. Dominate the Battlefield.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, no one wins alone. Coordination, strategy, and teamwork are essential to achieving victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call of Smoking Snakes</strong> delivers direct combat, competitive multiplayer action, and respect for history — all with a strong focus on gameplay.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call of Smoking Snakes</strong> is a multiplayer FPS set during World War II, focused on intense combat, teamwork, and territory control. Jump into fast-paced online battles, choose your class, and fight across varied maps that demand strategy, smart positioning, and coordinated teamplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you choose your side: <strong>Smoking Snakes</strong> or <strong>Black Eagles</strong> — two opposing forces locked in direct conflict for control of the battlefield. Every match features constant firefights, coordinated advances, and split-second decisions that can turn the tide of battle at any moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classes and Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on different roles on the frontline, such as <strong>infantry</strong>, <strong>sniper</strong>, <strong>machine gunner</strong>, or <strong>bazooka</strong>, each with a clearly defined tactical purpose. Use historical weapons, take advantage of the terrain, and work together with your team to capture and hold strategic objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is direct and intense: every weapon has weight, every shot counts, and victory depends on collective performance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maps and Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps offer a wide range of scenarios, including <strong>tight indoor areas</strong>, <strong>narrow alleys</strong>, and <strong>open fields</strong>, requiring quick situational awareness and constant adaptation. There is no single way to play — success comes from knowing when to push, when to hold, and when to act as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why “Smoking Snakes”?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The name <strong>Smoking Snakes</strong> comes from a historical expression linked to the <strong>Brazilian Expeditionary Force (FEB)</strong>. Before Brazil entered the war, it was said that it would be “easier for a snake to smoke than for Brazil to fight in Europe.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Brazilian soldiers finally went into combat, they adopted the smoking snake as their symbol — turning doubt into identity and pride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Call of Smoking Snakes</strong>, this spirit represents determination, unity, and the idea that when the snake enters combat, <strong>it smokes</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Together. Dominate the Battlefield.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, no one wins alone. Coordination, strategy, and teamwork are essential to achieving victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call of Smoking Snakes</strong> delivers direct combat, competitive multiplayer action, and respect for history — all with a strong focus on gameplay.</p>", "short_description": "An intense multiplayer FPS set in World War II. Choose your side — Smoking Snakes or Black Eagles — pick your class, such as infantry, sniper, or bazooka, and fight across varied maps that demand strategy, smart positioning, and teamwork.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241280/bab8c3a7031a477bc03e4e438e044885991208d9/header.jpg?t=1770639354", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241280/2abe4ba8f04438a9ae42f5faae7c88b53d41a363/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770639354", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241280/2abe4ba8f04438a9ae42f5faae7c88b53d41a363/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770639354", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 (4 GB) or AMD Radeon R9 380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> An active internet connection is required for multiplayer matches. Performance may vary depending on system configuration and network quality.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super or AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 MB available spac